sais.goose adapts the SA-IS implementation and explanation in
ruslano69/kanzi-rs, crates/kanzi/src/sais.rs (Apache License 2.0).
Changes: Goose implementation, byte S/L flags, shared bucket scratch per induced
pass, explicit level stack and arenas; reduced input retains its unique sentinel.
The BWT wrapper, MTF/zero-run, Huffman and archive modules and other original files remain MIT.
The included Apache license applies to sais.goose; retain this notice and both
licenses when distributing the combined compressor.
